17
00:00:26.875 --> 00:00:27.575
Because at the end of the day

18
00:00:27.575 --> 00:00:29.035
your calendar tells the truth about what

19
00:00:29.035 --> 00:00:31.095
your priorities are and if we're going

20
00:00:31.095 --> 00:00:33.035
to build a territory plan that delivers

21
00:00:33.035 --> 00:00:34.315
results we got to make sure our

22
00:00:34.315 --> 00:00:36.445
